§ `s 320.101 -- Definition of conversion therapy`

-- 320.101: "conversion therapy means a practice, treatment or service designed to" (a) to (f); the closing words "this definition does not include" are a flat negative.
-- src:6156 | 320.101 In sections 320.102 to 320.104, conversion therapy means a practice, treatment or service designed to
-- src:6157 | (a) change a person’s sexual orientation to heterosexual;
-- src:6158 | (b) change a person’s gender identity to cisgender;
-- src:6159 | (c) change a person’s gender expression so that it conforms to the sex assigned to the person at birth;
-- src:6160 | (d) repress or reduce non-heterosexual attraction or sexual behaviour;
-- src:6161 | (e) repress a person’s non-cisgender gender identity; or
-- src:6162 | (f) repress or reduce a person’s gender expression that does not conform to the sex assigned to the person at birth.
-- src:6163 | For greater certainty, this definition does not include a practice, treatment or service that relates to the exploration or development of an integrated personal identity — such as a practice, treatment or service that relates to a person’s gender transition — and that is not based on an assumption that a particular sexual orientation, gender identity or gender expression is to be preferred over another.
@ref s 320.101 (src:6156-6163)
GIVEN `it is designed to change a person’s sexual orientation to heterosexual` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is designed to change a person’s gender identity to cisgender` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is designed to change a person’s gender expression so that it conforms to the sex assigned to the person at birth` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is designed to repress or reduce non-heterosexual attraction or sexual behaviour` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is designed to repress a person’s non-cisgender gender identity` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is designed to repress or reduce a person’s gender expression that does not conform to the sex assigned to the person at birth` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it relates to the exploration or development of an integrated personal identity` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is not based on an assumption that a particular sexual orientation, gender identity or gender expression is to be preferred over another` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 320.101 the practice, treatment or service is conversion therapy` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `it relates to the exploration or development of an integrated personal identity` AND `it is not based on an assumption that a particular sexual orientation, gender identity or gender expression is to be preferred over another` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "this definition does not include a practice, treatment or service that relates to the exploration or development of an integrated personal identity — such as a practice, treatment or service that relates to a person’s gender transition — and that is not based on an assumption that a particular sexual orientation, gender identity or gender expression is to be preferred over another"
        IF `it is designed to change a person’s sexual orientation to heterosexual` OR `it is designed to change a person’s gender identity to cisgender` OR `it is designed to change a person’s gender expression so that it conforms to the sex assigned to the person at birth` OR `it is designed to repress or reduce non-heterosexual attraction or sexual behaviour` OR `it is designed to repress a person’s non-cisgender gender identity` OR `it is designed to repress or reduce a person’s gender expression that does not conform to the sex assigned to the person at birth` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "conversion therapy means a practice, treatment or service designed to" (a "means" definition: none of (a) to (f) holds)

§ `s 320.102 -- Conversion therapy`

-- src:6165 | 320.102 Everyone who knowingly causes another person to undergo conversion therapy — including by providing conversion therapy to that other person — is
-- src:6166 | (a) guilty of an indictable offence and liable to imprisonment for a term of not more than five years; or
-- src:6167 | (b) guilty of an offence punishable on summary conviction.
@ref s 320.102 (src:6165-6167)
GIVEN `the answer of s 320.101` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the person knowingly causes another person to undergo it, including by providing it to that other person` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 320.102 the person is guilty of the offence of causing another person to undergo conversion therapy` MEANS
    IF (`the answer of s 320.101` EQUALS JUST TRUE) AND `the person knowingly causes another person to undergo it, including by providing it to that other person`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Everyone who knowingly causes another person to undergo conversion therapy — including by providing conversion therapy to that other person"

@ref s 320.102 (src:6165-6167)
`s 320.102 the class of the offence` MEANS `an offence that the section makes both indictable and punishable on summary conviction`

@ref s 320.102 (src:6166-6167)
GIVEN mode IS A `Mode of proceeding`
      `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS A Punishment
GIVETH A Punishment
`s 320.102 the punishment` MEANS
    CONSIDER mode
    WHEN `by indictment` THEN Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `five years`), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
